      '# system.capabilities\n\n入口：`const systems = await editor.component.query({type:"FarmingSystem"});` 按身份选取 system。\n调用：await system.capabilities(input)\n查询当前可执行的操作与依赖；无 farmId 时读取系统通用能力，scope.kind=system；这时 interactionHostBound/targetQueryAvailable/presentation=null 表示未选择农场，不能推断任何农场不可用；用 list 得到 farmId 后再查区域能力。指定 farmId 才查询区域交互宿主，targetQueryAvailable 指示 getTarget 是否可用。presentation 是 interactionHostBound 的兼容别名，不等于诊断中的表现资源就绪。 只读，指定未知区域 NOT_FOUND；operations 是当时的能力事实，执行前仍须校验，不能解锁未初始化或禁用区域。\n\n成功返回 {ok:true, value, context?}；下方 Value 是 result.value 的类型。失败抛出结构化错误。\n\n```ts\ntype Input = { readonly farmId?: string | undefined; };\ntype Value = FarmingCapabilities;\n```\n\n## 返回与输入依赖类型\n```ts\nexport interface FarmingCapabilities {\n    /** Omitted farmId queries system defaults, not the aggregate readiness of all farms. */\n    readonly scope: {\n        readonly kind: "system" | "farm";\n        readonly farmId: string | null;\n    };\n    /** A farm interaction host is bound. null means no farm was selected; it is not an unavailable farm. This is NOT rendering/resource readiness. */\n    readonly interactionHostBound: boolean | null;\n    /** The bound interaction host supplies camera/point target lookup. */\n    readonly targetQueryAvailable: boolean | null;\n    readonly operations: readonly (("getDiagnostics" | "list" | "get" | "capabilities" | "getCatalog" | "getTarget" | "queryPlots" | "getEnvironment" | "damageCrop" | "getPlot" | "inspectCultivation" | "getAvailableActions" | "createPlot" | "updatePlot" | "deletePlot" | "plant" | "irrigate" | "harvest" | "hoe" | "getFieldValues" | "getContainers" | "setContainerCount" | "withdrawInventory" | "consumeBasket" | "getInventory" | "queryItems" | "getCarry" | "getItemTotals" | "generateItems" | "pickupItem" | "placeItem" | "useCarriedItem" | "unloadBasket" | "verify"))[];\n    readonly unavailableOperations: readonly (("getDiagnostics" | "list" | "get" | "capabilities" | "getCatalog" | "getTarget" | "queryPlots" | "getEnvironment" | "damageCrop" | "getPlot" | "inspectCultivation" | "getAvailableActions" | "createPlot" | "updatePlot" | "deletePlot" | "plant" | "irrigate" | "harvest" | "hoe" | "getFieldValues" | "getContainers" | "setContainerCount" | "withdrawInventory" | "consumeBasket" | "getInventory" | "queryItems" | "getCarry" | "getItemTotals" | "generateItems" | "pickupItem" | "placeItem" | "useCarriedItem" | "unloadBasket" | "verify"))[];\n    readonly unsupported: readonly string[];\n    readonly editablePlotFields: readonly string[];\n    /** @deprecated Use interactionHostBound. This legacy alias does not report rendering readiness. */\n    readonly presentation: boolean | null;\n}\n\n```\n\n写入选项及完整类型：[完整声明](declare/editor/farming/FarmingSystem.d.ts)。读取若返回 next，按 next.offset 续读。'
