    path: "declare/editor/farming/methods/getCatalog.md",
    content:
      '# system.getCatalog\n\n入口：`const systems = await editor.component.query({type:"FarmingSystem"});` 按身份选取 system。\n调用：await system.getCatalog(input)\n读取真实可用种子、作物、生长周期、growthFactors 生长因素阈值、产物及storage容器类型/逐作物容量（仓储篮子为硬容量，马车为显示容量，上限60份）；播种使用 seedId，收获使用 cropInstanceId。growthFactors 的 minimum/maximum 是生长边界，optimalMinimum/optimalMaximum 是适宜范围，单位与 getPlot.crop.factors 一致；根据实际读回决定是否浇水，不修改目录。farmId 必须已配置资源；资源不一致 INVALID_DEFINITION。只读结果中的 seed.cropId 应能在 crops 中找到。growthTarget 是成长量，baseGrowthUnitsPerSecond 是每秒速率，理想成熟毫秒数为两者之比乘 1000；产物数量为整数。\n\n成功返回 {ok:true, value, context?}；下方 Value 是 result.value 的类型。失败抛出结构化错误。\n\n```ts\ntype Input = { readonly farmId: string; };\ntype Value = FarmingCatalogView;\n```\n\n## 返回与输入依赖类型\n```ts\nexport interface FarmingCatalogView {\n    readonly storage: FarmingStorageDefinitions;\n    readonly seeds: readonly SeedDefinition[];\n    /** Read-only thresholds use the same units as getPlot.crop.factors. Compare observed values with optimalMinimum/optimalMaximum; queries never change rules. */\n    readonly crops: readonly Pick<CropDefinition, "id" | "name" | "cycle" | "harvest" | "growthFactors">[];\n}\nexport interface FarmingStorageDefinitions {\n    readonly containers: readonly StorageContainerDefinition[];\n    readonly crops: Readonly<Record<string, CropStorageDefinition>>;\n}\nexport interface StorageContainerDefinition {\n    readonly id: string;\n    readonly name: string;\n    readonly appearance: "cart" | "basket";\n    /** Full footprint in metres, including wheels and shafts. */\n    readonly width: number;\n    readonly depth: number;\n}\nexport interface CropStorageDefinition {\n    readonly containerTypeId: string;\n    /** Basket inventory limit; cart display slots (also bounded by CART_DISPLAY_LIMIT). */\n    readonly capacity: number;\n    readonly unit: string;\n}\nexport interface SeedDefinition {\n    readonly id: string;\n    readonly name: string;\n    readonly cropId: string;\n    readonly description: string;\n}\nexport interface CropDefinition {\n    readonly id: string;\n    readonly version: number;\n    readonly name: string;\n    readonly cycle: CropGrowthCycleDefinition;\n    readonly growthFactors: CropGrowthFactors;\n    readonly appearance: PlantAppearanceBinding;\n    readonly harvest: Readonly<{\n        itemId: string;\n        itemName: string;\n        quantity: number;\n    }>;\n}\nexport interface CropGrowthCycleDefinition {\n    readonly id: string;\n    readonly revision: number;\n    readonly growthTarget: number;\n    readonly baseGrowthUnitsPerSecond: number;\n    readonly stages: readonly CropStageDefinition[];\n}\nexport interface CropStageDefinition {\n    readonly id: string;\n    readonly name: string;\n    readonly minimumProgress: number;\n}\nexport type CropGrowthFactors = Readonly<Record<CropGrowthFactorId, CropGrowthFactorDefinition>>;\nexport type CropGrowthFactorId = "soilMoisture" | "airTemperature" | "light" | "soilPh" | "pestPressure";\nexport interface CropGrowthFactorDefinition {\n    readonly minimum: number;\n    readonly optimalMinimum: number;\n    readonly optimalMaximum: number;\n    readonly maximum: number;\n}\nexport interface PlantAppearanceBinding {\n    readonly plantId: string;\n    readonly plantRevision: number;\n    readonly recipeRevision: number;\n    readonly ageByStage: readonly {\n        readonly stageId: string;\n        readonly age: number;\n    }[];\n    readonly emergence: {\n        readonly start: number;\n        readonly end: number;\n    };\n}\n```\n\n写入选项及完整类型：[完整声明](declare/editor/farming/FarmingSystem.d.ts)。读取若返回 next，按 next.offset 续读。'
